# Blur Cards — five Skia cards stacked over a pre-blurred violet radial
# background (offscreen surface snapshot); a tap anywhere springs them
# (dampingRatio 0.7, overshoots) into a rotated 3D fan with growing BackdropBlur
# and stroke opacity, the next tap folds them back.
# What this test covers: fan out, fold back, re-tapping while the underdamped
# spring is overshooting (blur clamped at >= 0 when progress dips below 0),
# rapid taps, taps at the screen corners (full-screen pressable), and settling.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/blur-cards"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 45000
# Warm-up touch on the status bar: the first touch of a test can be lost while
# the XCTest runner attaches.
press 330 20
wait 500
wait 1500
press 201 437
wait 2500
press 201 437
wait 2500
# Re-tap mid-spring in both directions.
press 201 437
wait 500
press 201 437
wait 300
press 201 437
wait 2500
press 201 437 --count 6 --interval-ms 120
wait 2500
press 60 780
wait 1500
press 340 780
wait 2500
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
